 daily planners on the &quot;MINE&quot; page. You will find that the days using todo-list task manager, you are getting better and better.<br><br>Below permissions may need when you use related features.<br>\u2022 READ_CALENDAR<br>\u2022 WRITE_CALENDAR<br>\u2022 RECORD_AUDIO<br>\u2022 READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE<br>\u2022 WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE<br><br>Email : todolist@betterapptech.com",
